      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 Update Experience Group Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Search for Experience Group ID | (Optional) Retrieve active Experience Groups and identify the target groupId required for the update operation. |\n| 3 | Update Experience Group | Update the name and/or description of an existing Experience Group using the specified groupId. |"
